to-be-incorporated-into-paper-129 = referring (cons "**Instance arguments.** A binder `{{e : C A}}` is an implicit argument found by instance search" (cons "(PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.12 “E28 — Elaboration”): among the `instance` declarations in scope (`instance eqNat : Eq Nat` before a" (cons "definition), the latest whose result type matches the argument's type, as far as the signature" (cons "and the solutions so far tell it, is tried; the match binds the candidate's own implicit" (cons "arguments and its instance arguments are searched in turn; a candidate the checker rejects" (cons "is given up for the next; a variable in scope of the type (a function's own `{{e}}`) comes" (cons "first. `{{e}}` gives one by hand, and names it in a clause." (cons "" nil)))))))) (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Instance arguments.** A binder `{{e : C A}}` is an implicit argument found by instance search" (cons "(PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.12 “E28 — Elaboration”): among the `instance` declarations in scope (`instance eqNat : Eq Nat` before a" (cons "definition), the latest whose result type matches the argument's type, as far as the signature" (cons "and the solutions so far tell it, is tried; the match binds the candidate's own implicit" (cons "arguments and its instance arguments are searched in turn; a candidate the checker rejects" (cons "is given up for the next; a variable in scope of the type (a function's own `{{e}}`) comes" (cons "first. `{{e}}` gives one by hand, and names it in a clause." nil)))))))
