to-be-incorporated-into-paper-135 = referring (cons "**Regions as state.** `lib/region.cub` threads a region, `Bytes n`, through a program as" (cons "state: `RM n A = Region n → Region n × A`, pointers as offsets with their proof (`Ptr n`)," (cons "`rd`/`wr`/`rmodify` the byte layer's accesses, `run-fresh n m`, `enter-at a n m` for memory the" (cons "program does not own; `rd-wr` and `rd-wr-disj` are its laws. The region is unique along the" (cons "thread. A byte string quotes as a code (the" (cons "fresh string, then a store per nonzero word)." (cons "" nil))))))) (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Regions as state.** `lib/region.cub` threads a region, `Bytes n`, through a program as" (cons "state: `RM n A = Region n → Region n × A`, pointers as offsets with their proof (`Ptr n`)," (cons "`rd`/`wr`/`rmodify` the byte layer's accesses, `run-fresh n m`, `enter-at a n m` for memory the" (cons "program does not own; `rd-wr` and `rd-wr-disj` are its laws. The region is unique along the" (cons "thread. A byte string quotes as a code (the" (cons "fresh string, then a store per nonzero word)." nil))))))
